## File Structure (enforce strictly)

```
src/
├── lib/
│   ├── printful.ts          # Axios client (single source)
│   ├── banxico.ts           # FX rates
│   └── logger.ts            # Pino
├── services/
│   ├── catalog.service.ts   # Sync products CRUD
│   ├── orders.service.ts    # Order lifecycle
│   ├── shipping.service.ts  # Rate quotes
│   ├── webhooks.service.ts  # Event handlers
│   └── invoicing.service.ts # CFDI via PAC
├── routes/
│   ├── checkout.routes.ts
│   ├── catalog.routes.ts
│   └── webhooks.routes.ts
├── jobs/
│   ├── syncCatalog.job.ts   # Daily cron
│   ├── retryFailed.job.ts
│   └── tokenExpiry.job.ts
├── schemas/                 # Zod schemas (NEVER inline)
│   ├── order.schema.ts
│   └── webhook.schema.ts
├── db/
│   ├── schema.sql
│   └── migrations/
└── types/
    └── printful.types.ts    # Type definitions
```

**Rule:** if you need a new file, place it in the correct folder. Never put services in `routes/` or vice versa.

