## Environment Variables

```bash
# .env.example — copy to .env, never commit .env
NODE_ENV=development
APP_URL=https://api.tu-tienda.mx

# Printful
PRINTFUL_TOKEN=                          # Required. From developers.printful.com/tokens
PRINTFUL_STORE_ID=                       # Only if account-level token

# Webhook security
WEBHOOK_SECRET=                          # Long random string, in URL path

# Banxico (FX rates)
BANXICO_API_TOKEN=

# Database
DATABASE_URL=postgres://user:pass@host:5432/dbname

# Redis (BullMQ)
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379

# CFDI / PAC
PAC_PROVIDER=facturama                   # or sw_sapien, konfio
PAC_API_KEY=
PAC_RFC_EMISOR=                          # Your business RFC

# Payment processor
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
# or
CONEKTA_PRIVATE_KEY=
```

