## When in doubt

1. Re-read this file.
2. Check the official docs (link above).
3. If the docs are ambiguous, **ask the user before implementing**.
4. Never invent endpoints or fields not documented here.
5. Prefer explicit + verbose code over clever one-liners — this codebase will be maintained by other devs.
